### Create a Recipient
POST http://localhost:8080/recipients
Content-Type: application/json

{
"name": "andrew",
"email": "andrew@boost.com"
}

### Create a Special Offer
POST http://localhost:8080/offers
Content-Type: application/json

{
"name": "NEW2BOOST",
"percentageDiscount": 15.0
}

### Create a Voucher (update IDs as needed)
POST http://localhost:8080/vouchers/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
"recipientEmail": "andrew@boost.com",
"offerName": "NEW2BOOST",
"expirationDate": "2025-12-31"
}
